license: BUSL-1.1
license-url: "https://github.com/CD-LC/vegaduta/blob/main/LICENSE"
# version and date-released: the latest release in CHANGELOG.md (bumped with each release, see
# docs/maintainers/releasing.md; sdk/test/citation.test.mjs checks the pair against CHANGELOG.md).
version: 0.1.12
date-released: "2026-10-26"
abstract: >-
  VegaDūta is a self-hostable, multi-tenant platform for building AI agents,
  orchestrating them in workflows with human approval, grounding them in
  tenant data, and connecting them to messaging channels. It supports the
  Model Context Protocol (client and server), Agent2Agent, AG-UI and
  OpenTelemetry.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - agentic-ai
  - model-context-protocol
  - a2a
  - workflow
  - rag
  - multi-tenant
